# dialog window and meta data configuration
BASE_STACK_OVERVIEW_TOTAL_MESSAGE="
${COLOR_BLACK}${COLOR_BOLD}Platform Summary and Minimum Required Docker Configs${COLOR_NORMAL}

    The following services represent the minimum viable environment for operation and will be automatically deployed

        Commerce Edition   ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}\${PLATFORM_EDITION}${COLOR_NORMAL}
        Commerce Version   ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}Version \${PLATFORM_VERSION}${COLOR_NORMAL}
        Commerce Frontend  ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}\${FRONTEND_TYPE}${COLOR_NORMAL}

        PHP                ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}Version \${PHP_VERSION}${COLOR_NORMAL}
        Web Server         ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}Nginx${COLOR_NORMAL}
        Database           ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}MySQL Version \${MYSQL}${COLOR_NORMAL}
        Search Engine      ${COLOR_GREEN}${COLOR_BOLD}OpenSearch Version \${OPEN_SEARCH_VERSION}${COLOR_NORMAL}

        Domain             ${COLOR_YELLOW}${COLOR_BOLD}\${DOMAIN}${COLOR_NORMAL}

${COLOR_BLACK}${COLOR_BOLD}NOTE:${COLOR_NORMAL}
  - These services will be installed after the setup process is complete."

